This project generates a solution to the beam bending Dirichlet problem presented in HW3.
To run the project, run "Homework 3.py".

To change the desired trajectory over time, modify the following lines in HW4:

x_mid_c = rodLength / 2 * np.cos(np.pi/2 * timeStep/1000)
y_mid_c = - rodLength / 2 * np.sin(np.pi/2 * timeStep/1000)